  "type": "module",
  "description": "Isometric line illustrations that answer the pointer, built on the Hairline engine and painted with Cyclone UI theme tokens. Includes the createIllustration factory (react-native-svg, so one illustration runs on web, React Native and the server), the illustration engine (HL), and thirty-three illustrations: Hairline's figures, from Basket to Vault. Each takes intensity, animated, play, label, onRead, strokeWidth and palette props.",
